# Python for Engineers

My solutions to the Python for Engineers module on TrenTorch (https://trentorch.com).

## What's in here

Each problem gets its own .py file, named after the TrenTorch problem slug (e.g. python-what-a-variable-is.py). Every file contains:

- The problem name and difficulty
- My working solution, passing all TrenTorch tests
- Short notes on the approach and anything I learned

